                    {
                      "text": " Cemented mature water tanks, drip set mandatory."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "block_quote"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n   1. The applicant must be a farmer.\n   1.  The applicant must be a resident of Gujarat.\n   1. The applicant must plan to construct a cemented water storage tank of at least 25.50 cubic meters capacity.\n\n&gt; **Note:** Cemented mature water tanks, drip set mandatory.\n\n"
        },
        "schemeContent": {
          "benefitTypes": {
            "id": 1,
            "label": "Cash",
            "value": "cash"
          },
          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "Unit cost of construction:"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " ₹1,00,000/- per tank."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "For General category farmers:"
                        },
                        {
                          "text": " 50% subsidy, up to ₹50,000/-."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    },
                    {
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "bold": true,
                          "text": "For SC/ST farmers: "
                        },
                        {
                          "text": "75% subsidy, up to ₹75,000/-."
                        }
                      ],
                      "type": "list_item"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "ul_list"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n  - **Unit cost of construction:** ₹1,00,000/- per tank.  - **For General category farmers:** 50% subsidy, up to ₹50,000/-.  - **For SC/ST farmers:** 75% subsidy, up to ₹75,000/-.\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme provides financial assistance to farmers across Gujarat for constructing water storage tanks to support drip irrigation, with cost-sharing benefits based on farmer category.",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The scheme \"Construction of Water Storage Tanks for Drip Irrigation\" introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat,  aims to offer financial assistance to farmers for setting up cemented water tanks essential for efficient drip irrigation.  It supports sustainable agriculture through water conservation, especially for horticultural practices."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme &amp;quot;Construction of Water Storage Tanks for Drip Irrigation&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat,  aims to offer financial assistance to farmers for setting up cemented water tanks essential for efficient drip irrigation.  It supports sustainable agriculture through water conservation, especially for horticultural practices.\n",
